.TH soundcraft-cli-parity 1  "parity " 
.SH NAME
soundcraft\-cli\-parity \- Print the parity report (markdown)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsoundcraft\-cli parity\fR [\fB\-\-write\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the parity report (markdown)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-write\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Write the report to this file instead
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
